### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

### Ask the campus agent
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "AI讲座怎么报名？"
}

### Send feedback
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chat_id": 1,
  "rating": "up",
  "comment": "回答清楚"
}

### Recent logs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/logs?limit=5
